        "text": "You have now worked through the main skills in order of operations, bodmas, brackets and modulus.\n\nBefore finishing, explain one example aloud in your own words: what did you do first, why was that step first, and how did you check the result?\n\nIf you can explain the order of the steps, you are much less likely to be trapped by a longer objective question.",
